flowchart TB
  U[Internet users] --> IGW[Internet Gateway]
  IGW --> ALB[ALB across public-a/b]
  subgraph AZa[AZ a]
    NATa[NAT-a]
    APPa[App servers app-a]
    DBa[(PostgreSQL primary db-a)]
    RDa[(Redis node db-a)]
  end
  subgraph AZb[AZ b]
    NATb[NAT-b]
    APPb[App servers app-b]
    DBb[(PostgreSQL standby db-b)]
    RDb[(Redis replica db-b)]
  end
  ALB --> APPa & APPb
  APPa --> DBa & RDa
  APPb --> DBa & RDa
  DBa -.replication.-> DBb
  RDa -.replication.-> RDb
  APPa --> NATa --> IGW
  APPb --> NATb --> IGW